Genocide?  A bit of a sore point at the moment...  my 20th level Barbarian
(+5 Magicbane, 240hp, AC only -12 though) found a scroll:

"You have discovered a scroll of genocide! --More--"
"What do you want to genocide?"

Uh-oh.  Is it cursed?  Hmm,  looks like he's going to have to take a guess.
He doesn't want to genocide wraiths or nurses, they've been good to him
lately.  Okay then, master liches it is.

"Sent in some master liches..."

AAARRRGGH!  Run away!  Run away! 5 turns later, there's 7 or so master
liches, 20 dragons (give or take), 4 or 5 xorn, and gawd knows what else.

That has got to be the dumbest thing I've ever done.

Still, 240hp and one Amulet of Life Saving later, he escaped downstairs, 
and I'm glad to report he's still alive.  The only problem being, they're
waiting...

What a game!



